## Round-12 summary

* `premise_dbg` is now **FRZ-agnostic**: `DbgWire.real` (`frz = false`) deleted;
  `hc8` (`RLVP`) splits on `(dbgCtrlIn s pin).frz` (frozen: `dbgNext_rlvp` gives
  `m.dbg.rlvp`, `rlvPrevNext` gives `s.dbgCtrl.rlvPrev`, joined by
  `DbgRel.rlvp_eq`).  All other fields were already `FRZ`-agnostic.
* `ExplicitPremises.rlvpFrozen` deleted (false after the machine fix).
* `OpenWiring` deleted (it held only `dbgReal`); `premises_of`,
  `chip_step_refines'`, `trace_refines'_all`, `trace_refines'` and
  `streamRelX_step` no longer take it.
* Every one of the sixteen `Premises` fields is now discharged; the trace
  theorem carries only `cont.ramOwner = 0`, the per-cycle mode-quietness contract
  and `ExplicitPremises` (the global string tables, group packing, the two cycle
  contracts, the two AMBIG configuration-write facts and the latch-bank
  contract).

